<title>USA: Calif. officials to announce Shasta Lake project.</title>
<headline>Calif. officials to announce Shasta Lake project.</headline>
<dateline>SACRAMENTO, Calif. 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>California state and local officials on Tuesday will announce a $100 million project in Shasta Lake, Calif.</p>
<p>Company officials will be joined by state and local representatives on Tuesday to announce the manufacturing expansion project. According to a statement issued by the state, the project would bring 160 jobs to Shasta County.</p>
<p>The California Trade and Commerce Agency declined to provide additional details about the company or project ahead of Tuesday's announcement.</p>
</text>
